--- PHOTO GALLERY (VGA Mode 13h, 320x200x256, PCX) ---
PCX 128-byte header: Manufacturer 0x0A, Version 5, Encoding 1, BitsPerPixel 8
Images: cast_redford.pcx (320x200, RLE), cast_aykroyd.pcx, cast_poitier.pcx, sneakers_box.pcx
VGA framebuffer at A000:0000, Mode 13h (INT 10h AH=00h AL=13h)
Displayed via REP MOVSB to ES:A000, 64000 bytes per image

--- PRINT SPOOL -> LPT1 (ESC/P, 35 pages) ---
INT 21h AH=3Dh open "PRN" / "LPT1", H=handle, AH=40h write CX=bytes DS:DX=buffer, H=handle
ESC @ (init), ESC 3 24 (line spacing 24/216"), ESC * 0x73 (set graphics mode)
Pages: 1 Title, 2-5 Cast bios, 6-10 Plot/Production, 11-20 8x10 Photos (raster), 21-35 Credits
DOSBox-X captures as PNG per page (Epson FX-1050 emulation) or PostScript .ps/.pdf
Reference: jasomill.at/sneakers.txt (35 pages, 122K text, 192.8K JPEG)
Sent to LPT1: captured as sneakers_print.pcl / sneakers.pdf
